    <bpmn:process id="W_W520" name="W520. Age-Restricted Product Verification &amp; Compliance at POS" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Barcode scan of age-restricted SKU at POS or SCO
Frequency: Multiple daily per store — estimated 5–10 age-restricted transactions per store per day (solvents, thinners, spray paints, cutting tools, pesticides)
Volume: ~1,000–2,000 age-restricted transactions/day chain-wide
Owner: Cashier (verification); Store Manager (compliance oversight)
Participants: Cashier, Customer, Store Manager (escalation), Compliance Team (audit)
Source: workflow W520 — Age-Restricted Product Verification &amp; Compliance at POS</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W520_LaneSet5">
        <bpmn:lane id="W520_Lane1" name="Cashier">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W520_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W520_Task10</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W520_Task11</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W520_Task13</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W520_Task14</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W520_Start6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W520_Lane2" name="System">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W520_Task8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W520_Task9</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W520_Task12</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W520_Task15</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W520_Lane3" name="Compliance Team">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W520_Task16</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W520_Lane4" name="Store Manager">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W520_Task17</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W520_End18</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W520_Start6" name="Barcode scan of age-restricted SKU at POS or SCO">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W520_Flow21</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:serviceTask id="W520_Task7" name="Customer brings age-restricted items to checkout; Cashier scans barcode; system…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Customer brings age-restricted items to checkout; Cashier scans barcode; system identifies SKU as age-restricted from item master flag (per DENR/FPA-regulated chemicals, cutting tools, solvents list maintained in W252 item master)
Responsible (R): Cashier / System
Accountable (A): —
Duration: Per scan</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W520_Flow21</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W520_Flow22</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:serviceTask>
      <bpmn:serviceTask id="W520_Task8" name="System interrupts transaction flow: POS terminal displays full-screen…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: System interrupts transaction flow: POS terminal displays full-screen age-verification prompt showing item name, minimum age requirement (18 for solvents, cutting tools, pesticides per FPA regulations; configurable per SKU), and &quot;Request Government-Issued Photo ID&quot; instruction to cashier
Responsible (R): System
Accountable (A): —
Duration: Automated</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W520_Flow22</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W520_Flow23</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:serviceTask>
      <bpmn:serviceTask id="W520_Task9" name="Customer-facing display shows &quot;Age Verification Required&quot; message (does not…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Customer-facing display shows &quot;Age Verification Required&quot; message (does not display specific product or reason to protect customer privacy)
Responsible (R): System
Accountable (A): —
Duration: Automated</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W520_Flow23</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W520_Flow24</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:serviceTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W520_Task10" name="Cashier verbally requests customer&#x27;s government-issued photo ID (acceptable…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 4: Cashier verbally requests customer&#x27;s government-issued photo ID (acceptable forms: Philippine driver&#x27;s license, passport, PhilHealth ID, SSS ID, GSIS ID, COMELEC voter&#x27;s ID, national ID, postal ID with photo)
Responsible (R): Cashier
Accountable (A): —
Duration: 30 sec</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W520_Flow24</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W520_Flow25</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W520_Task11" name="Cashier selects ID type from dropdown on POS terminal; enters customer date of…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 5: Cashier selects ID type from dropdown on POS terminal; enters customer date of birth from ID or scans ID barcode (if machine-readable)
Responsible (R): Cashier
Accountable (A): —
Duration: 30 sec</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W520_Flow25</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W520_Flow26</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:serviceTask id="W520_Task12" name="System calculates customer age from date of birth; if age ≥ minimum age…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 6: System calculates customer age from date of birth; if age ≥ minimum age requirement: system displays &quot;VERIFIED — Age Confirmed&quot; on cashier screen; customer display returns to transaction total; transaction proceeds
Responsible (R): System
Accountable (A): —
Duration: Automated</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W520_Flow26</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W520_Flow27</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:serviceTask>
      <bpmn:serviceTask id="W520_Task13" name="If age &lt; minimum age requirement: system displays &quot;DENIED — Customer Below…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 7: If age &lt; minimum age requirement: system displays &quot;DENIED — Customer Below Required Age&quot; on cashier screen; customer-facing display shows &quot;Transaction Restricted&quot;; system removes age-restricted item(s) from transaction; remaining non-restricted items continue to checkout; Cashier informs customer that specific item(s) cannot be sold due to age restriction
Responsible (R): Cashier / System
Accountable (A): Store Manager
Duration: 30 sec</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W520_Flow27</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W520_Flow28</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:serviceTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W520_Task14" name="If customer cannot produce valid ID: system denies sale of age-restricted…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 8: If customer cannot produce valid ID: system denies sale of age-restricted item(s) per same step 7 procedure; customer can still purchase non-restricted items in transaction
Responsible (R): Cashier
Accountable (A): —
Duration: 30 sec</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W520_Flow28</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W520_Flow29</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:serviceTask id="W520_Task15" name="System logs age verification event: transaction ID, SKU(s) verified, customer…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 9: System logs age verification event: transaction ID, SKU(s) verified, customer age or &quot;No ID&quot; status, cashier ID, verification result (verified/denied/no ID), timestamp; log available for DENR/FPA compliance audit
Responsible (R): System
Accountable (A): —
Duration: Automated</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W520_Flow29</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W520_Flow30</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:serviceTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W520_Task16" name="Monthly: Compliance Team runs age-restricted product compliance report —…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 10: Monthly: Compliance Team runs age-restricted product compliance report — verification rate (% of age-restricted transactions where verification was completed), denial rate, &quot;No ID&quot; rate by store; stores with verification rate &lt; 95% flagged for retraining (W518)
Responsible (R): Compliance Team
Accountable (A): Legal/Compliance Head
Duration: 1 hour/month</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W520_Flow30</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W520_Flow31</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W520_Task17" name="Quarterly: Store Manager conducts spot-audit: observes 5 random age-restricted…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 11: Quarterly: Store Manager conducts spot-audit: observes 5 random age-restricted transactions at checkout (or reviews CCTV W71 footage of age-restricted scans) to verify cashiers are following ID request and verification procedure; documents observations in compliance log
Responsible (R): Store Manager
Accountable (A): Regional Manager
Duration: 30 min/quarter</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W520_Flow31</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W520_Flow32</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W520_End18" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W520_Flow32</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W520_Annotation19">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-265 (ensure controlled execution — POS Compliance &amp; Controls (PA-08.3).) | - operational: quarterly spot-audits and verification rate monitoring
Owner: Cashier (verification); Store Manager (compliance oversight)</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
