    <bpmn:process id="W_W540" name="W540. POS BIR Invoice Reprint, Adjustment &amp; Credit Note Issuance" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Customer requests receipt/invoice reprint; cashier discovers error requiring invoice adjustment; return/refund requires BIR credit note
Frequency: ~14,000 reprints/month (~0.5% of transactions); ~56,000 credit notes/month (~2% return rate)
Volume: Peak: post-sale events when customers submit receipts for reimbursement
Owner: Store Manager (reprint authorization); Finance (credit note compliance)
Participants: Cashier, Customer, Store Manager, Finance (credit note review)
Source: workflow W540 — POS BIR Invoice Reprint, Adjustment &amp; Credit Note Issuance</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W540_LaneSet4">
        <bpmn:lane id="W540_Lane1" name="Cashier">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W540_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W540_Start5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W540_Lane2" name="System">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W540_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W540_Task8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W540_Task10</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W540_Task11</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W540_Lane3" name="Store Manager">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W540_Task9</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W540_End12</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W540_Start5" name="Customer requests receipt/invoice reprint; cashier discovers error requiring invoice…">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W540_Flow15</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W540_Task6" name="Receipt reprint request">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Receipt reprint request: customer requests copy of receipt; cashier looks up original transaction by date, receipt number, or loyalty ID; system verifies original transaction exists and belongs to requesting customer (loyalty ID or payment card match); cashier requests reprint authorization from Store Manager
Responsible (R): Cashier
Accountable (A): Store Manager
Duration: 2–3 min</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W540_Flow15</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W540_Flow16</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:serviceTask id="W540_Task7" name="BIR-compliant reprint">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: BIR-compliant reprint: system prints reprint with &quot;REPRINT&quot; watermark, original receipt number, original date/time, and reprint date/time; reprint does NOT generate a new sequential invoice number; system logs reprint with cashier ID, reason, and timestamp for audit trail; customer signs reprint acknowledgment log (paper or digital)
Responsible (R): System / Cashier
Accountable (A): Store Manager
Duration: 1 min</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W540_Flow16</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W540_Flow17</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:serviceTask>
      <bpmn:serviceTask id="W540_Task8" name="Credit note for return/refund">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Credit note for return/refund: when processing return or refund (W12, W529), system automatically generates BIR-compliant credit note: (a) new sequential credit note number from CAS-registered range, (b) references original sales invoice number and date, (c) lists returned items with original prices, (d) shows VAT amount being reversed, (e) shows total credit amount, (f) customer name and TIN if available, (g) BIR CAS permit number; credit note printed in duplicate (customer copy + file copy)
Responsible (R): System
Accountable (A): Store Manager
Duration: Automated (part of return processing)</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W540_Flow17</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W540_Flow18</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:serviceTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W540_Task9" name="Debit note for price correction">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 4: Debit note for price correction: when a post-sale price correction is required (pricing error discovered after transaction completion), Store Manager initiates debit note: (a) references original sales invoice, (b) shows price difference, (c) shows additional VAT, (d) customer signs debit note; debit note requires Finance Manager approval for amounts &gt; PHP 5,000
Responsible (R): Store Manager / Finance
Accountable (A): Finance Manager
Duration: 5–10 min</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W540_Flow18</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W540_Flow19</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:serviceTask id="W540_Task10" name="Voided transaction documentation">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 5: Voided transaction documentation: when a transaction is voided per W529 (void authorization), system prints void document referencing original invoice number with &quot;VOIDED&quot; watermark, void reason, authorizer ID, and timestamp; voided invoice number preserved in sequence (not reused) per BIR requirements; void document filed for BIR audit
Responsible (R): System / Cashier
Accountable (A): Store Manager
Duration: Automated (part of void processing)</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W540_Flow19</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W540_Flow20</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:serviceTask>
      <bpmn:serviceTask id="W540_Task11" name="BIR audit trail maintenance">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 6: BIR audit trail maintenance: all reprints, credit notes, debit notes, and void documents automatically indexed and retained in POS transaction archive; 10-year retention per BIR requirements (NFR-006); monthly summary generated for Finance review; supporting documentation for BIR audit per W77 (BIR audit response)
Responsible (R): System
Accountable (A): Finance
Duration: Automated + 30 min/month review</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W540_Flow20</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W540_Flow21</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:serviceTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W540_End12" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W540_Flow21</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W540_Annotation13">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-265 (ensure controlled execution — POS Compliance &amp; Controls (PA-08.3).) | - operational: system-enforced sequential integrity with void-if-error fallback; operational: provides lookup alternative (payment card, loyalty ID); operational: &quot;REPRINT&quot; watermark and log of all reprints
Owner: Store Manager (reprint authorization); Finance (credit note compliance)</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
      <bpmn:association id="W540_Assoc14" sourceRef="W540_Annotation13" targetRef="W540_Start5" associationDirection="None" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W540_Flow15" sourceRef="W540_Start5" targetRef="W540_Task6" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W540_Flow16" sourceRef="W540_Task6" targetRef="W540_Task7" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W540_Flow17" sourceRef="W540_Task7" targetRef="W540_Task8" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W540_Flow18" sourceRef="W540_Task8" targetRef="W540_Task9" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W540_Flow19" sourceRef="W540_Task9" targetRef="W540_Task10" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W540_Flow20" sourceRef="W540_Task10" targetRef="W540_Task11" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W540_Flow21" sourceRef="W540_Task11" targetRef="W540_End12" />
    </bpmn:process>
    <bpmndi:BPMNDiagram id="W540_diag">
      <bpmndi:BPMNPlane id="W540_plane" bpmnElement="W_W540">
        <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="W540_Lane1_di" bpmnElement="W540_Lane1" isHorizontal="true"><dc:Bounds x="160" y="80" width="1580" height="170" /></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
